---
---
<section class="testimonials">
  <div class="container test-container">
    <div class="test-header">
      <h2>What <span>Our Customers</span> Say</h2>
      <p>Here you will see our customers' feedback. There are so many customers who are very happy to choose us as their flooring partner.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="test-grid">
      <div class="test-card">
        <div class="quote-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <p>"Woodcove Flooring has truly amazed me! We love the quality of the hardwood and the amazing job of the installation. Highly recommend them for anyone!"</p>
        <div class="test-author">
          <h4>Sarah M.</h4>
          <span>Müşteri</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="test-card">
        <div class="quote-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <p>"The entire process was smooth and hassle-free. The floors are stunning and incredibly durable. I am extremely pleased with Woodcove's service."</p>
        <div class="test-author">
          <h4>James L.</h4>
          <span>Müşteri</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonials {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background: #ffffff;
  }
  .test-container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .test-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
  }
  .test-header h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .test-header h2 span {
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }
  .test-header p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .test-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 30px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .test-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
  .test-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
    padding: 3rem 2.5rem 2.5rem 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  .test-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }
  .quote-icon {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .test-card p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #555;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .test-author {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }
  .test-author h4 {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .test-author span {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #888;
  }
</style>
